{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzlers... prepare to meet your Doom.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.poster.avif?t=1771466521\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.webm?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.mp4?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks for Babies crosses roguelite block-stacking with first-person carnage. Form complete rows to clear lines in 2D, shoot to kill in 3D, and help Flapper clean up his blocks by any means necessary.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/6575a1b8a6ffa3177f12774cb0198c6c.poster.avif?t=1771466521\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/6575a1b8a6ffa3177f12774cb0198c6c.webm?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/6575a1b8a6ffa3177f12774cb0198c6c.mp4?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stack falling tetrominos</strong> in classic arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Shoot and destroy blocks</strong> in first-person\u2014fix mistakes, set up line clears, and fight the demonic horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability</strong> with randomized boards and roguelite progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious story</strong>\u2014conquer devilish boss fights across distinct worlds to uncover the truth </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art that's worthy of the fridge</strong>\u2014a satisfying mix of lush pixel art and retro 3D graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.poster.avif?t=1771466521\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.webm?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.mp4?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft a unique build with every roguelite run!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Equip powerful abilities</strong> that trigger with each line clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a wide selection of upgrades</strong>, like passive perks, life-saving activatables, and satisfying weapon mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unlock new weapons</strong>, each with unique gunplay and game-changing effects on the 2D block-stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose what challenges you take on</strong> and what rewards you play for</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Keep getting stronger</strong> by purchasing persistent unlocks and rewards between runs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.poster.avif?t=1771466521\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.webm?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.mp4?t=1771466521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable puzzle game. Brutal first-person shooter. With their powers combined, these disparate genres unlock a new dimension of gameplay satisfaction. We call that a baby boomer shooter... you'll call it your new favorite game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/5b5b8330d94dd5863a4885038f10c4e2.apng?t=1771466521\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/5b5b8330d94dd5863a4885038f10c4e2.poster.avif?t=1771466521\" class=\"bb_img\" width=546 height=546 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2776770?t=1771466521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771466521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/c727af8e9ce5a475cc8c6060c3a9eb84fcd96471/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771466521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/c727af8e9ce5a475cc8c6060c3a9eb84fcd96471/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771466521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{